      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-international-production-orders-act-2021.pdf, p.219",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information is authorized if it complies with an order or request from a foreign country under a designated international agreement.",
