      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Has duty to disclose IPO information.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasDuty",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In this section: Australian Designated Authority official means:  (a) the Australian Designated Authority; or  (b) a person who:  (i) is an APS employee in the Department administered by the Attorney-General; and  (ii) has duties relating to the functions or powers of the Australian Designated Authority under Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979."
    },
